Z||000005||Capt Fiero||09-19-2001||11:34 PM||||Then theres alaways the gas powered leaf blower hooked to the TB on the V6 to give you quick turbo power. LOL.  Seriously, though, if you are looking for just a cool air kick, get a small NOS bottle (sneaky pete, 1 pound bottle.  Hook up a 25hp dry jet. (used in motorcycles) It will safly give you a very cold air shot, with more of a boost in power than you could ever get from a modified AC unit.  I would even bare to guess you could run it right from idle to redline without ever seeing any damage to your motor as long as it is set to a W/O throttle switch. Also that 1 lb bottle will last for a long time with such a small shot and bottle refils will be 5$. not 50$ (speaking in CDN$) ||||reg||1
